Hello All,

Harco cannot recommend the butt fusion of SIDR pipe to BF IPS fittings or f=
or that matter SIDR pipe to SIDR pipe.

Butt fusion equipment is conceived and designed for OD controlled pipe.  It=
 only fits OD controlled pipe.  The OD of SIDR pipe is different than OD co=
ntrolled pipe and varies from SIDR to SIDR.

It may be that someone can brute force something but we don't want to say t=
hat they should or take responsibility for the result because of our recomm=
endation.

John

=3D

